# Using a TV Game Show to Explain the Concept of a Dominant Strategy.

**Authors:** Trandel, Gregory A.

## Abstract
Illustrates the game-theory concept of a dominant strategy using the MTV-network game show &quot;Singled Out.&quot; Describes how the game show works and why this makes it attractive as an example of strategic behavior. Presents examples of how the show is used in class. (DSK)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ588679

